  "solution": "**Calculations:**\n\nLet the unknown number be 'a'.\n\n(25% × 800) + (30% × 120) = 190 + (23% of a)\n\n⇒ (25% × 800) + (30% × 120) - 190 = (23% × a)\n\n⇒ (0.25 × 800) + (0.30 × 120) - 190 = (0.23 a)\n\n⇒ 200 + 36 - 190 = 0.23a\n\n⇒ 10 + 36 = 0.23a\n\n⇒ a = 46/0.23 \n\n⇒ 200.\n\n**∴ The simplified value will be 200.**",
